{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 20, :comments ["<b>And the field was established.</b> An expression of permanence, like ״יקום עליה״ (it shall be established upon her). It established them on the day they heard. To say that after Sarah was buried in it, the field was confirmed and held fast for Abraham as a burial estate." "<b>From the children of Heth.</b> That he took the city's official seal and the formal ratification of the transfer of the field, so that they would not say: Ephron has no authority to expand a place of impurity among us."], :book :genesis, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 23, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T15:05:27.894983112Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}